'''Malik''' is an [[NPC]] located in the [[Catacombs Entrance]] and the [[Dungeon Hub]]. They allow the player to dungeonize and star their gear, grants access to both the [[Essence Shops#Wither|Wither]] and [[Essence Shops#Undead|Undead Essence Shops]] but not to its [[Salvaging]] menu.

