== Trivia ==
*The name [[w:Malik (name)|Malik]] originated in West Asia, used in Arabic, Urdu, Persian, Hebrew, Aramaic among other languages. It has multiple latinised spellings with similar meanings, such as: Malik or Malek meaning "owner" in Arabic or Malyk and Malyeek which mean "king".

